  "label": "Rainbow symbolizes LGBTQ+ pride, which is mocked by the text",
  "description": "The visual of the rainbow behind the golden retriever is mapped onto the textual concept of 'LGBTQ+ Pride Month' as a symbol of celebration. The meme uses this visual to ironically contrast with the text's claim that homosexuality is a 'tragedy', thereby mocking the pride symbol. The rainbow's presence is not neutral; it is explicitly used to represent LGBTQ+ identity, which the text then devalues.",
